   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hurricane Ian</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disaster Relief Response with rescue boats, backhoes, chainsaw, tarping, and muck an gut teams is what we do best with over 45 Domestic disaster deployments in the last 10 years. Florida teams are deploying and Louisiana and Texas teams on the way as of 9/27. East coast teams will come to assist also.  Clearing roads and trees off house, General Debris removal, delivering  supplies to most affected areas, and coordinating logistics for a continuous supply chain is just a few task we perform.</narrative>
  </description>
